# 12 October 2026: S3 harvest, family B of the shader bank: noise (value, gradient, simplex, worley, fbm, ridged,
# turbulence, domain warp), film grain, ordered and IGN dithering, one-pass bloom, analytic gaussian, directional and
# defocus blurs on procedural fields, chromatic aberration, lens flare streak, ghosts and halo, colour grading
# (lift gamma gain, exposure, contrast, saturation), tone mapping (ACES filmic, AgX, Neutral from three.js r185, MIT),
# mask transitions (wipe, iris, clock, dissolve, blinds, cross-fade) and OKLab keyframed colour transitions.
# Every block is one GLSL ES 3.0 function plus a numpy twin with the same formula. Multi-pass effects (bloom, blur,
